ven if  she doesn't pop up the film will feature  several  other new faces including julian  dennison as madison russell's bff  rebecca hall is a scientist with  connections to kong brian tyree henry is  a disgruntled apex employee and more  the story that will lead us to the  titular showdown in godzilla vs kong  begins with kong skull island the  earliest set film in the monster verse  so far  that story features a group of monarch  researchers heading to the titular  island and discovering the giant ape  known as kong  when we last left the big ape he was  still on his island having defeated the  skull crawler monsters who also dwelt  there  skull island is set in 1973 while the  first two godzilla films take place in  the present day  at a time when monarch is trying to  learn as much as possible about the  giant monsters called titans  which includes godzilla this escalates  when a fringe group begins triggering an  accelerated awakening of titans around  the world in an effort to cleanse the  planet  in the process they release the alien  titan known as king ghidorah the giant  guardian moth known as mothra and the  massive flying creature rodan  the climax of king of the monsters finds  ghidorah and godzilla engaging in combat  to determine the alpha of the titans  and with mothra's help godzilla  ultimately wins the fight  it's here in the wake of godzilla's  victory that kong will enter the pitcher  once again  at the end of king of the monsters we  learn that some of the titans have begun  moving to skull island and that ancient  drawings reveal that kong and godzilla  have faced off before  godzilla king of the monsters  establishes that the only way forward  for humanity seems to be some  kind of coexistence with the titans  while the creatures cause rampant  destruction early on in the film once  godzilla takes control as alpha the  ecological benefits of titan rule begin  to reveal themselves  with godzilla vs kong this strange  relationship between hu